          "author": "isaacschepp",
          "created_at": "2026-05-21T18:26:48Z",
          "body_snippet": "## Context\n\nGLX currently runs **two** link-checking paths backed by **two** bespoke shell scripts:\n\n- `check-links.yml` \u2192 `scripts/check-links.sh` \u2014 internal/relative markdown links, on every PR.\n- `lychee.yml` \u2192 `scripts/extract-external-urls.sh` + `lychee` \u2014 external `https?://` links, weekly.\n\nTwo problems with the status quo:\n\n1. Both shell scripts carry the **same** code-block-aware `awk` extractor, and that extractor depends on a GNU-awk-only construct that breaks `make check-links` outsi"
        }
